$\n\n- The truth set of $Q(x)$ is \n\n$$\n{T}_{Q}=\\{3,6,9\\}\n$$\n\n \nand its complement is\n\n$$\n{\\overset{―}{T}}_{Q}=\\{2,4,5,7,8\\}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{T}_{P}\\cap {T}_{Q} & =\\{2,3,5,7\\}\\cap \\{3,6,9\\} \\\\  & =\\{3\\} \\\\ {\\overset{―}{T}}_{P}\\cap {\\overset{―}{T}}_{Q} & =\\{4,6,8,9\\}\\cap \\{2,4,5,7,8\\} \\\\  & =\\{4,8\\} \\\\ {T}_{P⇔Q} & =({T}_{P}\\cap {T}_{Q})\\cup ({\\overset{―}{T}}_{P}\\cap {\\overset{―}{T}}_{Q}) \\\\  & =\\{3\\}\\cup \\{4,8\\} \\\\  & =\\{3,4,8\\}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534912 17592186045417 true] [17592186443912 1062 #uuid "13bbe632-d3a1-5ea4-917d-ac97d5a9c56e" 13194139534912 17592186045417 true] [17592186443912 1063 #edb/ref 17592186381686 13194139534912 17592186045417 true] [17592186443913 1058 #edb/ref 17592186443915 13194139534912 17592186045417 true] [17592186443913 1062 #uuid "427c4899-8f2f-5df5-bfb1-7ef58c544fcd" 13194139534912 17592186045417 true] [17592186443913 1063 #edb/ref 17592186407606 13194139534912 17592186045417 true] [17592186443914 1058 #edb/ref 17592186443912 13194139534912 17592186045417 true] [17592186443914 1062 #uuid "bad485c1-18f8-57ef-850a-fe161c531db2" 13194139534912 17592186045417 true] [17592186443914 1063 #edb/ref 17592186443911 13194139534912 17592186045417 true] [17592186443915 1058 #edb/ref 17592186443914 13194139534912 17592186045417 true] [17592186443915 1062 #uuid "cbf2292b-9b8c-565b-b4c1-35f38e115eef" 13194139534912 17592186045417 true] [17592186443915 1063 #edb/ref 17592186381679 13194139534912 17592186045417 true] [17592186443916 1058 #edb/ref 17592186443913 13194139534912 17592186045417 true] [17592186443916 1062 #uuid "ecd1d17c-94e6-540b-ace4-f35a9f9b3d94" 13194139534912 17592186045417 true] [17592186443916 1063 #edb/ref 17592186381665 13194139534912 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"activity-1275d73e-e355-535a-8360-6bc7c66fdc10" 17592186443904 "answer-45fbefc3-395f-553e-8152-7832975cb2b4" 17592186443905 "answer-5745fcfd-fe55-53c5-a054-56fdf9cfc204